    "intro_html":  "Birria is the chile-braised beef that took over every taco truck for a reason, and folded into a crisped, cheesy tortilla it is one of the best things you can meal prep. The cheese here is dialed back hard to keep it honest, but between the guajillo and ancho adobo and the fatty shredded chuck, you will not miss it. Each burrito lands at about \u003cstrong\u003e395 calories\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e32 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e, in a tortilla with 18 grams of fiber for 5 grams of net carb. Our Beef Birria Rice Bowls give you the same braise over rice; this one crisps it inside the wrap with the cheese, closer to a quesabirria.",
